<title>JAPAN: Toyo Trust forgives loans to mortgage firms.</title>
<headline>Toyo Trust forgives loans to mortgage firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyo Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd said on Monday that it had forgiven a total of 175.4 billion yen worth of loans it extended to Juso Inc and Nippon Housing Loan Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The company forgave 105.2 billion yen worth of loans to Juso and 70.2 billion yen worth of loans to Nippon Housing, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It also said that the move would not affect its earnings for the current 1996/97 business year.</p>
</text>
